better112.option.render_distance=Render Distance
better112.option.render_distance.tooltip=How far away terrain is drawn. Shorter distances draw less terrain and raise frame rates the most of any setting.
better112.option.brightness=Brightness
better112.option.brightness.tooltip=Lifts the darkest parts of the world so they are easier to see. It does not change light levels for mob spawning.
better112.option.gui_scale=GUI Scale
better112.option.gui_scale.tooltip=Size of menus and the HUD, in half steps. Auto picks the largest whole size that fits the window. Half sizes (1.5x, 2.5x) fill the gap between too small and too large.
better112.option.gui_scale_sharp=Even Half Sizes
better112.option.gui_scale_sharp.tooltip=At a half size, draws the interface at twice the size and reduces it, so every pixel of it comes out the same width and text stays even, the way a screen with fractional scaling does it. Costs a little graphics time each frame. Things a mod sizes in raw screen pixels (a minimap's labels) come out half as large; such mods usually have a size setting of their own. Off: half sizes are drawn directly, with pixels alternately 2 and 3 wide.
better112.option.fullscreen=Fullscreen
better112.option.fullscreen.tooltip=Fills the whole display instead of running in a window.
better112.option.vsync=V-Sync
better112.option.vsync.tooltip=Matches the frame rate to the display's refresh rate. Removes tearing at the cost of a little input delay.
better112.option.max_fps=Max Framerate
better112.option.max_fps.tooltip=Caps the frame rate. A cap keeps the computer cooler and quieter when it could draw more frames than the display shows.
better112.option.background_fps=Background Framerate
better112.option.background_fps.tooltip=Caps the frame rate while the game window is not the active window, so a pack idling in the background does not hold the whole machine.
better112.option.view_bobbing=View Bobbing
better112.option.view_bobbing.tooltip=Sways the camera while walking. Turn it off if it makes you queasy.
better112.option.attack_indicator=Attack Indicator
better112.option.attack_indicator.tooltip=Where the attack cooldown meter is shown.

better112.option.graphics=Graphics Quality
better112.option.graphics.tooltip=Fancy draws see-through leaves, rounder clouds and a wider area of rain. Fast swaps those for cheaper versions.
better112.option.clouds=Clouds
better112.option.clouds.tooltip=Fancy clouds have depth, fast clouds are flat, and off removes them.
better112.option.weather_quality=Weather Quality
better112.option.weather_quality.tooltip=How far out rain and snow are drawn. Default follows Graphics Quality.
better112.option.leaves_quality=Leaves Quality
better112.option.leaves_quality.tooltip=Fancy leaves are see-through; fast leaves are solid. Smart draws the outer layers of a canopy see-through, a solid layer behind them and nothing deeper, so dense forests look like fancy and cost far less to build and draw. Default follows Graphics Quality.
better112.option.particles=Particles
better112.option.particles.tooltip=How many particles the game is allowed to spawn.
better112.option.smooth_lighting=Smooth Lighting
better112.option.smooth_lighting.tooltip=Blends light and shadow across block faces. Off gives hard-edged lighting per block.
better112.option.biome_blend=Biome Blend
better112.option.biome_blend.tooltip=How widely grass, leaf and water colours are blended across biome borders. Vanilla 1.12.2 always uses 3x3. Larger areas give softer borders and slower chunk building; None is the fastest.
better112.option.entity_distance=Entity Distance
better112.option.entity_distance.tooltip=Scales how far away mobs, items and other entities are drawn.
better112.option.entity_shadows=Entity Shadows
better112.option.entity_shadows.tooltip=Draws the soft round shadow under mobs and items.
better112.option.vignette=Vignette
better112.option.vignette.tooltip=Darkens the corners of the screen in dim places.
better112.option.mipmap_levels=Mipmap Levels
better112.option.mipmap_levels.tooltip=Smooths distant textures so they shimmer less. Changing it rebuilds the texture atlas, which takes a while in a large pack.

better112.option.chunk_threads=Chunk Update Threads
better112.option.chunk_threads.tooltip=How many threads build chunk meshes. More threads load terrain faster but compete with the game and the server for processor time. Default uses every core.
better112.option.defer_chunk_updates=Always Defer Chunk Updates
better112.option.defer_chunk_updates.tooltip=Builds every chunk update in the background instead of pausing the frame for nearby ones. Removes stutter when blocks change next to you; a changed block can take a moment longer to show.
better112.option.entity_culling=Entity Culling
better112.option.entity_culling.tooltip=Skips mobs, items and block entities such as chests, drawers and machines when solid blocks hide them completely. Helps most inside large enclosed bases.
better112.option.block_entity_distance=Block Entity Distance
better112.option.block_entity_distance.tooltip=Scales how far away chests, signs, machines and other animated blocks are drawn.
better112.option.particle_culling=Particle Culling
better112.option.particle_culling.tooltip=Skips particles that are outside the view.
better112.option.animate_visible_only=Animate Only Visible Textures
better112.option.animate_visible_only.tooltip=Only animates textures that are on screen. Large packs have hundreds of animated textures, and updating all of them every tick is wasted work.
better112.option.use_vbo=Use VBOs
better112.option.use_vbo.tooltip=Keeps chunk meshes in graphics memory. Almost always faster; turn it off only if terrain is drawn wrongly.

better112.option.animations=Animations
better112.option.animations.tooltip=Master switch for animated textures.
better112.option.anim_water=Water
better112.option.anim_water.tooltip=Animates water.
better112.option.anim_lava=Lava
better112.option.anim_lava.tooltip=Animates lava.
better112.option.anim_fire=Fire
better112.option.anim_fire.tooltip=Animates fire.
better112.option.anim_portal=Portal
better112.option.anim_portal.tooltip=Animates nether portals.
better112.option.anim_blocks=Block Animations
better112.option.anim_blocks.tooltip=Animates every other texture, including machines and fluids added by mods.

better112.option.particles_all=Particles
better112.option.particles_all.tooltip=Master switch for particles.
better112.option.rain_splash=Rain Splash
better112.option.rain_splash.tooltip=Splashes where rain hits the ground.
better112.option.block_break=Block Break
better112.option.block_break.tooltip=Fragments thrown when a block is destroyed.
better112.option.block_breaking=Block Breaking
better112.option.block_breaking.tooltip=Fragments thrown while a block is being mined.
better112.option.particle.explosion=Explosions
better112.option.particle.explosion.tooltip=Explosion flashes and blasts.
better112.option.particle.smoke=Smoke
better112.option.particle.smoke.tooltip=Smoke from torches, furnaces and fire, and puffs of cloud.
better112.option.particle.flame=Flames and Lava
better112.option.particle.flame.tooltip=Torch flames and popping lava.
better112.option.particle.water=Water
better112.option.particle.water.tooltip=Bubbles, splashes, wakes and raindrops.
better112.option.particle.drip=Dripping
better112.option.particle.drip.tooltip=Water and lava dripping through ceilings.
better112.option.particle.potion=Potion Swirls
better112.option.particle.potion.tooltip=Swirls from potion effects, witches and beacons.
better112.option.particle.portal=Portal
better112.option.particle.portal.tooltip=Purple motes from portals, endermen and ender chests.
better112.option.particle.enchant=Enchanting Glyphs
better112.option.particle.enchant.tooltip=Letters drifting from bookshelves to an enchanting table.
better112.option.particle.redstone=Redstone Dust
better112.option.particle.redstone.tooltip=Dust from powered redstone and coloured dust effects.
better112.option.particle.crit=Critical Hits
better112.option.particle.crit.tooltip=Critical hit stars and sweep attacks.
better112.option.particle.hearts=Hearts
better112.option.particle.hearts.tooltip=Hearts from breeding and villager moods.
better112.option.particle.note=Notes
better112.option.particle.note.tooltip=Notes from note blocks.
better112.option.particle.firework=Fireworks
better112.option.particle.firework.tooltip=Firework sparks and trails.
better112.option.particle.dust=Dust
better112.option.particle.dust.tooltip=Falling dust under sand and gravel, mycelium spores and block dust.
better112.option.particle.item=Item Fragments
better112.option.particle.item.tooltip=Fragments from eating, snowballs, slimes and breaking tools.
better112.option.particle.modded=Modded Particles
better112.option.particle.modded.tooltip=Every particle added by a mod.

better112.option.sky=Sky
better112.option.sky.tooltip=Draws the sky. Off leaves the plain fog colour.
better112.option.stars=Stars
better112.option.stars.tooltip=Draws stars at night.
better112.option.sun=Sun
better112.option.sun.tooltip=Draws the sun.
better112.option.moon=Moon
better112.option.moon.tooltip=Draws the moon.
better112.option.weather=Rain and Snow
better112.option.weather.tooltip=Draws falling rain and snow. Weather still happens; it is only hidden.
better112.option.fog=Fog
better112.option.fog.tooltip=Distance fog at the edge of the loaded terrain. Reduced pushes it back to the last few blocks; off removes it and shows where terrain ends.
better112.option.cloud_height=Cloud Height
better112.option.cloud_height.tooltip=The height the cloud layer sits at. Vanilla is 128.

better112.option.item_frames=Item Frames
better112.option.item_frames.tooltip=Draws item frames and what is in them.
better112.option.armor_stands=Armor Stands
better112.option.armor_stands.tooltip=Draws armor stands.
better112.option.paintings=Paintings
better112.option.paintings.tooltip=Draws paintings.
better112.option.pistons=Piston Animation
better112.option.pistons.tooltip=Draws pistons while they move. Off makes them snap between positions.
better112.option.beacon_beam=Beacon Beams
better112.option.beacon_beam.tooltip=Draws the beam above beacons.
better112.option.enchanting_book=Enchanting Table Book
better112.option.enchanting_book.tooltip=Draws the floating book on enchanting tables.
better112.option.player_name_tags=Player Name Tags
better112.option.player_name_tags.tooltip=Draws names above other players.

better112.option.show_fps=Show FPS
better112.option.show_fps.tooltip=Shows the frame rate in a corner of the screen.
better112.option.show_fps_extended=Extended FPS
better112.option.show_fps_extended.tooltip=Adds the average and the slowest 1% of recent frames. The low number is what stutter feels like.
better112.option.show_coords=Show Coordinates
better112.option.show_coords.tooltip=Shows your block position under the frame rate.
better112.option.overlay_corner=Overlay Corner
better112.option.overlay_corner.tooltip=Which corner the frame rate and coordinates sit in.
better112.option.toasts=Toasts
better112.option.toasts.tooltip=Pop-ups for advancements, recipes and tutorial hints.
better112.option.ore_dict_tooltips=Ore Dictionary in Tooltips
better112.option.ore_dict_tooltips.tooltip=Recipe slots in JEI that take any of several items name the ore dictionary entry they accept. While Shift is held, every item tooltip lists the ore dictionary names the item has.
better112.option.modern_textures=Modern Textures
better112.option.modern_textures.tooltip=Replaces vanilla block, item, mob and armor textures with the ones current Minecraft uses. They are read from a modern version installed on this computer and converted for 1.12.2.
better112.option.replace_video_settings=Use This Screen for Video Settings
better112.option.replace_video_settings.tooltip=Off brings back the vanilla Video Settings screen. This screen then opens from its key bind, or with Shift+P here to see the vanilla one.

