better112.option.ftb_quests.tooltip=Shows Better Questing's quests the way FTB Quests does: chapters down the left, round quest nodes on a canvas you drag and zoom, and quests opening as a window. The quests, progress and rewards are unchanged. The Classic button in the book opens the original screens.
