better112.option.dynamic_lights=Dynamic Lights
better112.option.dynamic_lights.tooltip=A torch, lantern or other glowing item lights the world around it while you hold it, and so do glowing items on the ground and anything on fire. The light reaches about eight blocks. Fast moves it a couple of times a second; fancy follows you closely and rebuilds chunks more often to do it.
better112.option.fov_effects=FOV Effects
better112.option.fov_effects.tooltip=How much sprinting, speed effects and drawing a bow widen or narrow your view. Vanilla added this slider in 1.16.
better112.option.damage_tilt=Damage Tilt
better112.option.damage_tilt.tooltip=How far the camera rolls when you take damage. Vanilla added this slider in 1.19.4.
better112.option.toggle_sprint=Sprint
better112.option.toggle_sprint.tooltip=Hold keeps sprinting only while the key is down. Toggle switches sprinting on and off with one press.
better112.option.toggle_sneak=Sneak
better112.option.toggle_sneak.tooltip=Hold sneaks only while the key is down. Toggle switches sneaking on and off with one press.
better112.option.pickup_notifier=Pick-Up Notifier
better112.option.pickup_notifier.tooltip=Lists what you just picked up, with counts, in the bottom right corner for a few seconds.
better112.option.effect_timers=Effect Timers
better112.option.effect_timers.tooltip=Shows the time left on each status effect icon in the corner of the screen.
better112.option.equipment_hud=Equipment Durability
better112.option.equipment_hud.tooltip=Shows your armor and held tools with the uses they have left at the left edge of the screen.
better112.option.durability_tooltip=Durability in Tooltips
better112.option.durability_tooltip.tooltip=Adds remaining and maximum durability to the tooltip of tools and armor.
better112.option.cell_contents=Storage Cell Contents
better112.option.cell_contents.tooltip=Lists what an Applied Energistics 2 storage cell holds in its tooltip, largest amounts first, as modern AE2 does. Hold Shift for a longer list.
better112.tree.in_network=In ME network: %s
better112.tree.network_craftable=Your ME network can craft this

