better112.picker.hint=type or paste hex
better112.option.sky_preset=Sky
better112.option.sky_preset.tooltip=The color of the daytime sky and the haze at the horizon. Night, rain and thunder still darken it. Pick a preset, or Custom to choose any color below. Purely cosmetic.
better112.option.sky_custom=Sky Color
better112.option.sky_custom.tooltip=Click to open the color picker: drag in the field and on the hue bar, or type or paste a hex code such as 78A7FF.
better112.option.water_preset=Water
better112.option.water_preset.tooltip=The color of water in the world. Pick a preset, or Custom to choose any color below. Water in tanks and buckets keeps its normal look. Purely cosmetic.
better112.option.water_custom=Water Color
better112.option.water_custom.tooltip=Click to open the color picker: drag in the field and on the hue bar, or type or paste a hex code such as 3F76E4.
