better112.option.chat_emotes=Chat Emotes
better112.option.chat_emotes.tooltip=Short codes in chat are drawn as pictures, as on Discord: :smile: :joy: :thumbsup: and about 80 more, and any item by name, such as :diamond:. While typing, a colon and two letters list the matches and Tab finishes the first. Players without the mod see the short code.
better112.option.chat_item_links=Items in Chat
better112.option.chat_item_links.tooltip=Hover an item in any inventory or in JEI and press Shift+T to show it in chat, or write [item] in a message to show what you are holding. Players with the mod can hover the name to see the item; everyone else sees its name.
better112.option.import_vanilla=Modern Minecraft Blocks and Biomes
better112.option.import_vanilla.tooltip=Reads the blocks Minecraft has gained since 1.12.2 that its newer biomes are made of (cherry, mangrove, pale oak and bamboo wood, deepslate, tuff, calcite, moss, mud, dripstone, amethyst, coral, kelp, seagrass and their plants) from a modern Minecraft installed on this computer, with their recipes. Modern Terrain worlds then have the newer biomes themselves: meadows, cherry groves, groves and snowy peaks, mangrove swamps, bamboo jungles, pale gardens, warm seas with coral reefs, frozen seas with icebergs, kelp and seagrass in all water, lush and dripstone caves, amethyst geodes. Takes effect after a restart. Worlds that use these blocks will miss them while this is off.
better112.option.import_bop=Biomes O' Plenty Import
better112.option.import_bop.tooltip=Reads the blocks, recipes and biomes of Biomes O' Plenty for modern Minecraft from its jar in better112/modern_mods and adds them to the game. The biomes appear in Modern Terrain worlds. Takes effect after a restart. Worlds that use these blocks will miss them while this is off.
better112.option.recipe_bookmarks=Recipe Bookmarks
better112.option.recipe_bookmarks.tooltip=In JEI, hold Shift and press the bookmark key over a recipe to bookmark that recipe instead of just the item. Its bookmark carries a folded corner, opens exactly that recipe, and shows it in place while Shift is held. Takes effect the next time JEI loads.
better112.unavailable.jei_utilities=JEI Utilities already bookmarks recipes in this pack: bookmark an item from inside a recipe.
better112.unavailable.no_jei=Needs JEI.
better112.option.command_suggestions=Command Suggestions
better112.option.command_suggestions.tooltip=While a command is typed, the commands and arguments that fit are listed above the chat line. Up and Down pick one, Tab takes it, Escape puts the list away.
better112.option.debug_keys=Newer F3 Keys
better112.option.debug_keys.tooltip=F3+F4 opens the game mode picker (tap F4 to step, let go of F3 to switch). F3+C copies where you stand as a teleport command. F3+I copies the block or entity you look at as a command.
better112.option.save_indicator=Saving Indicator
better112.option.save_indicator.tooltip=Shows "Saving world" in the bottom right corner whenever a single-player world is written to disk.
better112.option.offhand_swap=Off-Hand Key in Inventories
better112.option.offhand_swap.tooltip=Pressing the swap-hands key over a slot of your inventory swaps that slot with your off hand, in any container.
better112.option.game_rules_button=Game Rules at World Creation
better112.option.game_rules_button.tooltip=Adds a Game Rules button to More World Options when creating a world, so rules such as keeping the inventory are set before the world starts.
better112.recipe_mark.kind=%s recipe
better112.recipe_mark.hint=Hold Shift to see it
